   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Hello,<br></div><div><br></div><div>Out of curiosity, is it possible to get the abundance of clusters and individuals (including CV, se etc.) using the `dht2` function, similar to the `ds` function with summary?<br><br>Alternatively, should I manually remove the &quot;size&quot; column if I want to estimate the abundance of clusters with all the associated information?<br><br>I ask this question because I intend to compare the abundance of clusters and individuals.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Thank you in advance</div><div><br>Best regards,<br>Camille<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "zUTx8-qBAAAJ",
